---
config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Mobile / DXP / WordPress
  participant APIM
  participant API as Entitlements GET API
  participant Cache
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  App->>APIM: GET entitlements for contactId, with JWT
  APIM->>API: forward with subscription key and policy
  API->>Cache: lookup
  alt cache hit
    Cache-->>API: entitlements
  else cache miss
    API->>PG: query resolved entitlements
    PG-->>API: rows
    API->>Cache: populate with TTL
  end
  API-->>App: entitlement set in MembershipAccessControlItem shape